The bug was a [1mnull byte handling mismatch[22m between C and Rust.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Test vector 81 sends the input string [38;5;10myy\x00yy[0m (with an embedded null byte). In C:[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mfgets[0m reads the full line into the buffer (including the null byte)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mstrlen[0m measures the length by scanning until the first [38;5;10m\0[0m, returning [1m2[22m[0m[0m
- With length 2 and operation 0 (permissions), the code hits [38;5;10mlength < 3[0m and returns [1m-2[22m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
In the Rust translation:[0m[0m
